#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:16
msgid "1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:18
msgid ""
"Composio's interface is a nocturnal command center — a dense, developer-"
"focused darkness punctuated by electric cyan and deep cobalt signals. The"
" entire experience is built on an almost-pure-black canvas (`#0f0f0f`) "
"where content floats within barely-visible containment borders, creating "
"the feeling of a high-tech control panel rather than a traditional "
"marketing page. It's a site that whispers authority to developers who "
"live in dark terminals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:20
msgid ""
"The visual language leans heavily into the aesthetic of code editors and "
"terminal windows. JetBrains Mono appears alongside the geometric "
"precision of abcDiatype, reinforcing the message that this is a tool "
"built *by* developers *for* developers. Decorative elements are "
"restrained but impactful — subtle cyan-blue gradient glows emanate from "
"cards and sections like bioluminescent organisms in deep water, while "
"hard-offset shadows (`4px 4px`) on select elements add a raw, brutalist "
"edge that prevents the design from feeling sterile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:22
msgid ""
"What makes Composio distinctive is its tension between extreme minimalism"
" and strategic bursts of luminous color. The site never shouts — headings"
" use tight line-heights (0.87) that compress text into dense, "
"authoritative blocks. Color is rationed like a rare resource: white text "
"for primary content, semi-transparent white (`rgba(255,255,255,0.5-0.6)`)"
" for secondary, and brand blue (`#0007cd`) or electric cyan (`#00ffff`) "
"reserved exclusively for interactive moments and accent glows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:24
msgid "**Key Characteristics:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:25
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Pitch-black canvas with near-invisible white-border containment (4-12% "
"opacity)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:26
msgid ""
"Dual-font identity: geometric sans-serif (abcDiatype) for content, "
"monospace (JetBrains Mono) for technical credibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:27
msgid ""
"Ultra-tight heading line-heights (0.87-1.0) creating compressed, "
"impactful text blocks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:28
msgid ""
"Bioluminescent accent strategy — cyan and blue glows that feel like "
"they're emitting light from within"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:29
msgid "Hard-offset brutalist shadows (`4px 4px`) on select interactive elements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:30
msgid "Monochrome hierarchy with color used only at the highest-signal moments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:31
msgid "Developer-terminal aesthetic that bridges marketing and documentation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:33
msgid "2. Color Palette & Roles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:35
msgid "Primary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:36
msgid ""
"**Composio Cobalt** (`#0007cd`): The core brand color — a deep, saturated"
" blue used sparingly for high-priority interactive elements and brand "
"moments. It anchors the identity with quiet intensity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:38
msgid "Secondary & Accent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:39
msgid ""
"**Electric Cyan** (`#00ffff`): The attention-grabbing accent — used at "
"low opacity (`rgba(0,255,255,0.12)`) for glowing button backgrounds and "
"card highlights. At full saturation, it serves as the energetic "
"counterpoint to the dark canvas."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:40
msgid ""
"**Signal Blue** (`#0089ff` / `rgb(0,137,255)`): Used for select button "
"borders and interactive focus states, bridging the gap between Cobalt and"
" Cyan."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:41
msgid ""
"**Ocean Blue** (`#0096ff` / `rgb(0,150,255)`): Accent border color on CTA"
" buttons, slightly warmer than Signal Blue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:43
msgid "Surface & Background"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:44
msgid ""
"**Void Black** (`#0f0f0f`): The primary page background — not pure black,"
" but a hair warmer, reducing eye strain on dark displays."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:45
msgid ""
"**Pure Black** (`#000000`): Used for card interiors and deep-nested "
"containers, creating a subtle depth distinction from the page background."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:46
msgid ""
"**Charcoal** (`#2c2c2c` / `rgb(44,44,44)`): Used for secondary button "
"borders and divider lines on dark surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:48
msgid "Neutrals & Text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:49
msgid ""
"**Pure White** (`#ffffff`): Primary heading and high-emphasis text color "
"on dark surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:50
msgid ""
"**Muted Smoke** (`#444444`): De-emphasized body text, metadata, and "
"tertiary content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:51
msgid ""
"**Ghost White** (`rgba(255,255,255,0.6)`): Secondary body text and link "
"labels — visible but deliberately receded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:52
msgid ""
"**Whisper White** (`rgba(255,255,255,0.5)`): Tertiary button text and "
"placeholder content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:53
msgid ""
"**Phantom White** (`rgba(255,255,255,0.2)`): Subtle button backgrounds "
"and deeply receded UI chrome."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:55
msgid "Semantic & Accent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:56
msgid ""
"**Border Mist 12** (`rgba(255,255,255,0.12)`): Highest-opacity border "
"treatment — used for prominent card edges and content separators."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:57
msgid ""
"**Border Mist 10** (`rgba(255,255,255,0.10)`): Standard container borders"
" on dark surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:58
msgid ""
"**Border Mist 08** (`rgba(255,255,255,0.08)`): Subtle section dividers "
"and secondary card edges."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:59
msgid ""
"**Border Mist 06** (`rgba(255,255,255,0.06)`): Near-invisible containment"
" borders for background groupings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:60
msgid ""
"**Border Mist 04** (`rgba(255,255,255,0.04)`): The faintest border — used"
" for atmospheric separation only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:61
msgid ""
"**Light Border** (`#e0e0e0` / `rgb(224,224,224)`): Reserved for light-"
"surface contexts (rare on this site)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:63
msgid "Gradient System"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:64
msgid ""
"**Cyan Glow**: Radial gradients using `#00ffff` at very low opacity, "
"creating bioluminescent halos behind cards and feature sections."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:65
msgid ""
"**Blue-to-Black Fade**: Linear gradients from Composio Cobalt (`#0007cd`)"
" fading into Void Black (`#0f0f0f`), used in hero backgrounds and section"
" transitions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:66
msgid ""
"**White Fog**: Bottom-of-page gradient transitioning from dark to a "
"diffused white/gray, creating an atmospheric \"horizon line\" effect near"
" the footer."
msgstr ""

