#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:99
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:100
msgid ""
"**Compression creates authority**: Heading line-heights are drastically "
"tight (0.87-1.0), making large text feel dense and commanding rather than"
" airy and decorative."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:101
msgid ""
"**Dual personality**: abcDiatype carries the marketing voice — geometric,"
" precise, friendly. JetBrains Mono carries the technical voice — "
"credible, functional, familiar to developers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:102
msgid ""
"**Weight restraint**: Almost everything is weight 400 (regular). Weight "
"500 (medium) is reserved for small labels, badges, and select card "
"titles. Weight 700 (bold) appears only in microscopic system-monospace "
"contexts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:103
msgid ""
"**Negative letter-spacing on code**: JetBrains Mono uses negative letter-"
"spacing (-0.28px to -0.98px) for dense, compact code blocks that feel "
"like a real IDE."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:104
msgid ""
"**Uppercase is earned**: The `uppercase` + `letter-spacing` treatment is "
"reserved exclusively for tiny overline labels and technical tags — never "
"for headings."
msgstr ""

