#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:197
msgid "5. Layout Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:199
msgid "Spacing System"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:200
msgid "Base unit: 8px"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:201
msgid ""
"Scale: 1px, 2px, 4px, 6px, 8px, 10px, 12px, 14px, 16px, 18px, 20px, 24px,"
" 30px, 32px, 40px"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:202
msgid ""
"Component padding: typically 10px (buttons) to 24px (CTA buttons "
"horizontal)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:203
msgid ""
"Section padding: generous vertical spacing (estimated 80-120px between "
"major sections)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:204
msgid "Card internal padding: approximately 24-32px"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:206
msgid "Grid & Container"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:207
msgid "Max container width: approximately 1200px, centered"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:208
msgid "Content sections use single-column or 2-3 column grids for feature cards"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:209
msgid "Hero: centered single-column with maximum impact"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:210
msgid ""
"Feature sections: asymmetric layouts mixing text blocks with product "
"screenshots"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:212
msgid "Whitespace Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:213
msgid ""
"**Breathing room between sections**: Large vertical gaps create distinct "
"\"chapters\" in the page scroll."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:214
msgid ""
"**Dense within components**: Cards and text blocks are internally compact"
" (tight line-heights, minimal internal padding), creating focused "
"information nodes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:215
msgid ""
"**Contrast-driven separation**: Rather than relying solely on whitespace,"
" Composio uses border opacity differences and subtle background shifts to"
" delineate content zones."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:217
msgid "Border Radius Scale"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:218
msgid ""
"Nearly squared (2px): Inline code spans, small tags, pre blocks — the "
"sharpest treatment, conveying technical precision"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:219
msgid ""
"Subtly rounded (4px): Content cards, images, standard containers — the "
"workhorse radius"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:220
msgid ""
"Pill-shaped (37px): Select buttons and badges — creates a softer, more "
"approachable feel for key CTAs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:221
msgid ""
"Full round (9999px+): Circular elements, avatar-like containers, "
"decorative dots"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:223
msgid "6. Depth & Elevation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Level"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Treatment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Flat (Level 0)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "No shadow, no border"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Page background, inline text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Contained (Level 1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Border Mist 04-08, no shadow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Background groupings, subtle sections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Card (Level 2)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Border Mist 10-12, no shadow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Standard content cards, code blocks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Brutalist (Level 3)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Hard offset shadow (`4px 4px`, 15% black)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Select interactive cards, distinctive feature highlights"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Floating (Level 4)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Soft diffuse shadow (`0px 8px 32px`, 50% black)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md
msgid "Modals, overlays, deeply elevated content"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:233
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: Composio uses shadows sparingly and with "
"deliberate contrast. The hard-offset brutalist shadow is the signature — "
"it breaks the sleek darkness with a raw, almost retro-computing feel. The"
" soft diffuse shadow is reserved for truly floating elements. Most depth "
"is communicated through border opacity gradations rather than shadows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:235
msgid "Decorative Depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:236
msgid ""
"**Cyan Glow Halos**: Radial gradient halos using Electric Cyan at low "
"opacity behind feature cards and images. Creates a \"screen glow\" effect"
" as if the UI elements are emitting light."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:237
msgid ""
"**Blue-Black Gradient Washes**: Linear gradients from Composio Cobalt to "
"Void Black used as section backgrounds, adding subtle color temperature "
"shifts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:238
msgid ""
"**White Fog Horizon**: A gradient from dark to diffused white/gray at the"
" bottom of the page, creating an atmospheric \"dawn\" effect before the "
"footer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:240
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:242
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:243
msgid ""
"Use Void Black (`#0f0f0f`) as the primary page background — never pure "
"white for main surfaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:244
msgid ""
"Keep heading line-heights ultra-tight (0.87-1.0) for compressed, "
"authoritative text blocks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:245
msgid ""
"Use white-opacity borders (4-12%) for containment — they're more "
"important than shadows here"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:246
msgid ""
"Reserve Electric Cyan (`#00ffff`) for high-signal moments only — CTAs, "
"glows, interactive accents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:247
msgid ""
"Pair abcDiatype with JetBrains Mono to reinforce the developer-tool "
"identity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:248
msgid ""
"Use the hard-offset shadow (`4px 4px`) intentionally on select elements "
"for brutalist personality"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:249
msgid ""
"Keep button text dark (`oklch(0.145 0 0)`) even on the darkest "
"backgrounds — buttons carry their own surface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:250
msgid "Layer opacity-based borders to create subtle depth without shadows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:251
msgid ""
"Use uppercase + letter-spacing only for tiny overline labels (12px or "
"smaller)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:253
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:254
msgid "Don't use bright backgrounds or light surfaces as primary containers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:255
msgid ""
"Don't apply heavy shadows everywhere — depth comes from border opacity, "
"not box-shadow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:256
msgid ""
"Don't use Composio Cobalt (`#0007cd`) as a text color — it's too dark on "
"dark and too saturated on light"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:257
msgid ""
"Don't increase heading line-heights beyond 1.2 — the compressed feel is "
"core to the identity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:258
msgid ""
"Don't use bold (700) weight for body or heading text — 400-500 is the "
"ceiling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:259
msgid ""
"Don't mix warm colors — the palette is strictly cool (blue, cyan, white, "
"black)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:260
msgid ""
"Don't use border-radius larger than 4px on content cards — the precision "
"of near-square corners is intentional"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:261
msgid ""
"Don't place Electric Cyan at full opacity on large surfaces — it's an "
"accent, used at 12% max for backgrounds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:262
msgid ""
"Don't use decorative serif or handwritten fonts — the entire identity is "
"geometric sans + monospace"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_composio.md:263
msgid ""
"Don't skip the monospace font for technical content — JetBrains Mono is "
"not decorative, it's a credibility signal"
msgstr ""

